88886", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75308617_3813784452222219_8861854153164055038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5GWCBkmCbLsQ7kNvwFb8n_x&_nc_oc=Adm4hjlIxVUoNMhBbg-5Qnggr6tRk27iKQgRlpsduz6dDVP_PA37USdaqBL5nEFdpQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwpSES-oZmdNQg4v4fhwR3CSLoOdwyoP7GUjYNtRzadeA&oe=69B93F5A"}, {"file_name": "screen-4.png", "id": "510210628338938", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031359_510210631672271_3889054620789481961_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uZx5fZC9WL8Q7kNvwGClJ2t&_nc_oc=AdnwewLj6DtRt-Q98_KyDnQgYPr1QQadjckecPOdXjvTZDUk5Gp2XCHc7A7idEUrLNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyax7p1zueLcRYX49FElJtIOIlIbWDqEUrwDomNLg2vCQ&oe=69B945D3"}, {"file_name": "screen-5.png", "id": "1241621836834075", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031652_1241621840167408_8711678203036836320_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E1VRaaIf-0YQ7kNvwHCPpH_&_nc_oc=AdnUYs8_QPgQM3OsmeullbHMU-hThq2Ml_Heg_PHZpxCQ_vKbxa-_xI5z3I7phZ42n8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzBfiARFb1fWPgjI0T2hko28oriTyIU0Xzx826M-ZfNGg&oe=69B95ADF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mod3_Title.png", "id": "3693715237561510", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036644_3693715240894843_8945723129178385145_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DSGJ5OGFwnkQ7kNvwFTJDF1&_nc_oc=AdmKxg--01b8mxwFpyCax5nq-dsc4HUFn24Ik9kefkbvMZ6La3BN1jF5_cnTUpP7nyE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyI844_hZ8k3q_uOpjl5FvU6xv68ptYbqczPIY5lJbKXw&oe=69B93A3E"}, "display_name": "Hololab VR - NCSG Inspection Foundation Module 3: Masonry Wood External", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Hololab NCSG Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR Application**\n\nThe Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing. Users are challenged to perform inspections with randomized issues in a virtual residential setting, ensuring all necessary procedures are followed.\n\n**VR Controls and PPE \u2013** Learn how to navigate the virtual environment while getting acquainted with essential personal protective equipment.\n\n**Responsibility & Worksite Hazard Assessment \u2013** Operate in a simulated environment to identify and mitigate hazards commonly encountered during inspections of wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Familiarization \u2013** Understand different types of wood-burning freestanding stoves and their common features.\n\n**Freestanding Stove Inspection \u2013** Utilize the official NCSG checklist to thoroughly inspect wood-burning freestanding stoves.\n\n**Real-World Simulation \u2013** Complete the inspection by correctly identifying issues with maximum safety awareness and forensic skills.\n\nData reports for review are saved and stored for engagement metrics and simulation performance analysis.\n\nAny off-platform monetization of content accessible in this app conforms to the Oculus Bulk IAP or Subscription Licenses app policy outlined here: https://developer.oculus.com/policy/app-policies", "short_description": "The Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild Wood Burning Freestanding Stoves VR application provides users with essential skills to inspect and maintain wood-burning freestanding stoves in compliance with NCSG standards. This course features interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and detailed testing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com/privacy-app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "From the Future", "support_website_url": 